# Spec Document: Subproject 5 - Projects Showcase

## Overview
This subproject implements the Projects showcase section and dynamic routing for individual project details. The UI will feature a responsive grid of project cards that maintain the dark-mode, developer-focused "terminal" aesthetic. 

## Tech Stack & Libraries
- **Framework:** Next.js (App Router)
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS
- **Animations:** Framer Motion (for staggered grid entry animations)
- **Data Structure:** TypeScript

## Component Architecture

### 1. Data Definition (`content/projects.ts`)
Create a static data file to drive the project cards and dynamic routes.

**`content/projects.ts` Data Seed:**
- *Title:* Optimization of ATDD Execution Pipeline
- *Slug:* atdd-execution-pipeline
- *Date:* Jun 2026 - Present
